From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:14:44 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Meridian: the first run says what really happens

The setup step tells apart local and AI suggestions, the preview keeps
the spaces you already have in view and says click, and counts of one
read right. Ported onto the reworked first run; its dots stay as they
are, since its steps now change along the way.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
---
 .../webui_browser/meridian/onboarding.css     |  5 ++
 .../webui_browser/meridian/onboarding.html.ts | 17 +++++--
 .../webui_browser/meridian/onboarding.ts      | 50 ++++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 62 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/resources/webui_browser/meridian/onboarding.css b/chrome/browser/resources/webui_browser/meridian/onboarding.css
index c644806fdb..4566296f66 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/resources/webui_browser/meridian/onboarding.css
+++ b/chrome/browser/resources/webui_browser/meridian/onboarding.css
@@ -806,6 +806,11 @@ kbd {
   background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
 }
 
+.pv-space.kept {
+  color: rgba(23, 23, 28, 0.62);
+  cursor: default;
+}
+
 .pv-rows {
   display: flex;
   flex-direction: column;
diff --git a/chrome/browser/resources/webui_browser/meridian/onboarding.html.ts b/chrome/browser/resources/webui_browser/meridian/onboarding.html.ts
index 5d0390c9bb..2cf5eb4e49 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/resources/webui_browser/meridian/onboarding.html.ts
